      "parameters": {
        "content": "\u00c9xito del Cliente\n\nHEALTH: CRM \u2192 Score \u2192 Segmentaci\u00f3n \u2192 Churn Prediction\nONBOARDING: Teams \u2192 Gu\u00edas WhatsApp \u2192 Adopci\u00f3n\nCUENTAS: Teams QBR \u2192 Stripe Upsell \u2192 NPS\nALERTAS: Slack \u2192 Riesgo \u2192 Acci\u00f3n",
